head = trail.size();\n        // Copy the remaining watches:\n        while (i != end)\n            *j++ = *i++;\n    } else {\n        uncheckedEnqueue(first, cr);\n    }\n\nNextClause:;\n}\nws.shrink(i - j);'}])"
